/**
 * Ensures `DEFAULT_LOGO_DRIVE_FILE_ID` is present in ScriptProperties.
 * If missing, sets it to `12EKzWLkKL9XEdZVrJBzGNERdAd7BFi--` without overwriting
 * any existing value configured by the owner.
